# Requests for the VS / Rider / VS Code REST client.
# 1. Run "login" and copy the accessToken into @token.

@host = http://localhost:5001
@token = paste-the-access-token-here

### Login (credentials from your User Secrets: Seed:AdminEmail / Seed:AdminPassword)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "your-local-password"
}

### Invoices: approved, most recent first, 10 per page, only some fields
GET {{host}}/api/invoices?filter=[{"property":"Status","value":"Approved"}]&sort=[{"property":"IssueDate","direction":"desc"}]&page=1&limit=10&fields=Id,Number,TotalAmount,Status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Commissions of one seller
GET {{host}}/api/commissions?filter=[{"property":"Invoice.SellerId","value":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"}]
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/summary?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
